  <h1>No More Subscription Madness: Why KodiniTools Chooses Freedom Over Paywalls</h1>

  <div class="blog-meta">
    <span class="blog-meta-badge">Philosophy</span>
    <span>June 25, 2026</span>
    <span>· 4 min read</span>
  </div>

  <figure class="blog-demo">
    <img
      src="/image/kodinitools-blog.webp"
      alt="Illustrative image: a person working at a computer with digital tools and data overviews"
      width="1376"
